Subject: [PATCH] phy: rockchip: usbdp: complete the v7.4 backport on 6.18.65

Linux 6.18.65 already includes 15 patches from the v7.4 USBDP series.
Carry the remaining 11 in a refreshed delta against that stable baseline.

Remaining upstream changes:
31fadcc97c03 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Keep clocks running on PHY re-init
6bee51c8b7dc phy: rockchip: usbdp: Amend SSC modulation deviation
6977ac261a62 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Fix LFPS detect threshold control
ebe1e8cf3d10 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Rename DP lane functions
e8e7f3d875a3 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Use FIELD_PREP_WM16_CONST
9235d03d5e52 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Cleanup DP lane selection function
bcdb77332fe0 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Register DP aux bridge
4d8349799c4b phy: rockchip: usbdp: Re-init the PHY on orientation change
cc492941f8e3 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Factor out lane_mux_sel setup
f8e38359fde8 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Use guard functions for mutex
89eb5e8aec23 phy: rockchip: usbdp: Add some extra debug messages

ImmortalWrt packages aux-bridge.ko in kmod-drm-rockchip. Restrict
USBDP bridge registration to that display driver so the USB3 PHY can
load in configurations that enable DRM only for GPU or NPU support.

